            <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,Roboto,sans-serif' fontsize='12'>Gap = churn with the sign minus churn without it. Color = risk score points (4, 3, 2, 1).</run>
